      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4337,
      "text": "And it is He Who created all pair of things[6], and made for you ships and animals on which you ride,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 490,
      "ruku": 424,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4338,
      "text": "so that you may settle yourselves on their backs, then remember the blessings of your Lord when you have settled thereupon and say, “Glory be to Him Who has subjected this for us, for we could not have done it by ourselves[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 490,
      "ruku": 424,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4339,
      "text": "It is to our Lord that we will surely return.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 490,
      "ruku": 424,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4340,
      "text": "Yet they ascribe to Him some of His slaves as offspring[8]. Indeed, man is clearly ungrateful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 490,
      "ruku": 424,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4341,
      "text": "Has He taken for Himself daughters from what He has created, and favored you with sons?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 490,
      "ruku": 425,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4342,
      "text": "When one of them is given tidings of [a baby girl] the like of which he ascribes to the Most Compassionate, his face darkens as he suppresses his rage.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 490,
      "ruku": 425,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4343,
      "text": "Or [do they ascribe to Allah] one who is brought up in adornments and is not able to present a clear argument in disputation?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 490,
      "ruku": 425,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4344,
      "text": "They regard the angels, who are slaves of the Most Compassionate, as female. Did they witness their creation? Their testimony will be written, and they will be questioned!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 490,
      "ruku": 425,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4345,
      "text": "They say, “If the Most Compassionate had willed, we would not have worshiped them.” They have no knowledge of that; they do nothing but conjecture.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 490,
      "ruku": 425,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4346,
      "text": "Or have We given them a Book before this [Qur’an], to which they are holding fast?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 490,
      "ruku": 425,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4347,
      "text": "They rather say, “We found our forefathers on a path, and we are seeking guidance in their footsteps.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
